## Migration Notes

If you have existing code that catches exceptions, update it to check the `success` property instead:

**Before:**
```javascript
try {
  const result = await login(email, password);
  // Handle success
} catch (error) {
  // Handle error
}
```

**After:**
```javascript
const result = await login(email, password);
if (result.success) {
  // Handle success
} else {
  // Handle error with result.message
}
```

## Validation Rules

### Profile Update
- First name: Required, will be trimmed
- Last name: Required, will be trimmed
- Avatar: Optional, will be trimmed if provided

### Password Change
- Current password: Required
- New password: Required, minimum 6 characters
- User must not be disabled

### Login
- Email: Required, valid format
- Password: Required
- Account must not be disabled
- Account must not be locked out

